<title>USA: U.S. bulk millfeeds- Prices steady in quiet trade.</title>
<headline>U.S. bulk millfeeds- Prices steady in quiet trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Millfeed prices were mostly steady on Thursday in subdued activity, dealers said.</p>
<p>Buffalo dealers noted ample supply because mills were running during the weekend.</p>
<p>But one Texas dealer said business was active because of the drop in nearby prices.</p>
<p>Spot millfeed delivered to North Texas was traded at $130 a ton.</p>
</text>
